<title>AUSTRALIA: Fosters shares feature in turnover lists.</title>
<headline>Fosters shares feature in turnover lists.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Foster's Brewing Group Ltd featured  in turnover lists on Friday with 22.3 million shares traded.</p>
<p>The bulk of the turnover was in one line of 15.84 million shares specialled  through SBC Warburg at a price of A$2.57 per share. The parcels was  valued at A$40.72 million.</p>
<p>Brokers said the business appeared to be usual institutional trade.</p>
<p>By 3.30 p.m. (0530 GMT), Fosters shares were 0.8 cents lower at A$2.62.</p>
<p>--Walter Watson, Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
